			    [00. Total Sales],
			    FILTER(
			        dim_date,
			        dim_date[Year] = YEAR(TODAY()) &&
			        dim_date[Month] = MAX(dim_date[Month]) &&
			        dim_date[Date] <= TODAY()
			    )
			)
			
			```
